# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Committed ON PURPOSE so the repo is reproducible without re-scraping/embedding.
# (Listed here as documentation — these are NOT ignored:)
#   data/services.jsonl      source service records (scraper output, combined)
#   data/chunks.jsonl        chunked + synonym-enriched corpus (embedder input)
#   data/synonyms.jsonl      per-service synonym map (loanwords -> findable)
#   data/eval_questions.json labeled eval set (hit@k / MRR)
#   topic_clf.joblib         trained on/off-topic classifier
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
